<title>USA: Equity Marketing gets $8 mln in contracts.</title>
<headline>Equity Marketing gets $8 mln in contracts.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Marketing Inc said it received a series of promotional contracts totaling more than $8 million.</p>
<p>The company, which makes custom toy and gift products based on popular entertainment properties, said all of the orders are expected to be shipped in the first six months of 1997.</p>
</text>
